<title>USA: Duff &amp; Phelps rates Philippines' bond issue BB.</title>
<headline>Duff &amp; Phelps rates Philippines' bond issue BB.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Duff &amp; Phelps Credit Rating Co said Thursday it assigned a Double B rating to the forthcoming Philippines' global bonds, which are being issued in echange for the Philippines' Brady Par Bonds, Series A and B.</p>
<p>The total outstanding face value of the par bonds being offered for exchange is US$1.9 billion. Unlike the Brady bonds, the global bonds are not collateralized.</p>
<p>-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
